silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_08_cheese_and_failure_modes_sections_01_cheese_trap_face_closure_concrete_anchor#mittenscolimit silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensColimit is the colimit apex assembling head, torso, paws, and tail observations into the single individual Mittens-the-cat. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'colim_D_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
